OL,3,GNEWSA'Ridiculous' congestion after     
OL,4,Acollapse, locals say                   
OL,6,FTraffic measures put in place following
OL,7,Fa partial building site collapse have  
OL,8,Fled to "absolutely ridiculous"         
OL,9,Fcongestion around a major town,        
OL,10,Fresidents and businesses have told the 
OL,11,FBBC.                                   
OL,13,FCherwell Street in Banbury has been    
OL,14,Fmostly closed since an apartment block 
OL,15,Funder construction partly collapsed    
OL,16,Falongside scaffolding on 21 October -  
OL,17,Finjuring two.                          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
