OL,3,GNEWSA'Ridiculous' congestion after     
OL,4,Acollapse, locals say                   
OL,6,FFollowing the incident, the road's busy
OL,7,Fjunction with Bridge Street has been   
OL,8,Foperating four-way temporary traffic   
OL,9,Flights due to further concerns over the
OL,10,Fsafety of the structure.               
OL,12,FBut Paul Claydon, who owns Cherwell    
OL,13,FGarden Machinery on the corner of the  
OL,14,Fjunction, said the measures were "not  
OL,15,Fgood at all" for his business.         
